★ prop_delete 从 v0.6 起提升了 **52.6×**（`ignore_attributes` 优化），是本版本最大单项改善。

### 差距分类

| 类别 | 平均差距 | 影响项 |
|------|---------|--------|
| **字符串拼接** | 5.9× | string_build1/2 — 最慢项 |
| **TypedArray** | 4.3× | typed_array_read (5.8×), typed_array_write (2.8×) |
| **函数调用** | 5.0× | func_call (5.5×), closure_var (4.5×) |
| **数组/循环** | 3.3× | array_for_in (5.5×), array_for (4.7×), array_read (4.6×) |
| **数值运算** | 3.3× | int_arith (3.6×), float_arith (2.9×) |
| **全局变量** | 3.0× | global_read (4.3×), global_write (2.3×) |
| **属性操作** | 2.1× | prop_read/write (~2.2×), prop_delete (2.0×) |
| **已接近 QJS** | 0.9–1.3× | float_to_string (快1.1x), sort_bench, empty_loop |

